  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C008.signal_basis",
    "value": "Combine milestone events with contemporaneous questions about preparation and readiness, record repeated progress–waiting–return transitions with multiple or unknown reasons, and examine differences in waiting and returns. Multiple causes can coexist, and event timing alone cannot distinguish causes.",
    "scope": "Prospective investigation of onboarding trajectories. Questions may affect behavior and reports may be incomplete; observed transitions therefore inform testing of alternation without establishing a unique cause for each account.",
